TitLe 
personalized ecosystem for student

Objective:
* To develop a centralized platform for managing and monitoring student academic information.
* To create personalized learning paths based on each student's performance, strengths, weaknesses, and learning needs.
* To monitor students' academic progress continuously throughout their university journey.
* To analyze examination results and identify weak and strong subjects automatically.
* To provide AI-based personalized feedback and learning recommendations.
* To recommend relevant study materials, old question papers, quizzes, and practice exercises.
* To send personalized notifications about examinations, results, deadlines, and academic activities.
* To help teachers and universities monitor student performance through academic analytics.
* To track students' skills, achievements, projects, and overall development.
* To provide AI-based career guidance based on students' academic performance, skills, interests, and goals.
* To connect eligible students with suitable internship and job opportunities.
* To create a continuous ecosystem that supports students from university enrollment to graduation and career development.

## Functional Requirements

* Student login with university details.
* Student registration with personal and academic information.
* University and student verification.
* Automatic fetching of university data through secure API/connection(store in backend).
* Fetch academic calendar from the university.
* Fetch examination routine.
* Fetch subjects and course details.
* Fetch test and examination information.
* Fetch past-year question papers.
* Store fetched university data in the backend database.
* Create a complete student academic profile.
* Allow students to attend tests and examinations.
* Allow students to submit answers and examination files.
* Automatically evaluate tests where applicable.
* Automatically analyze student examination results.
* Identify student strengths and weaknesses.
* Track student academic performance over time.
* Provide personalized feedback based on student performance.
* Provide AI-based study recommendations.
* Set personalized goals for upcoming examinations.
* Suggest important and less-important topics.
* Create personalized study plans.
* Recommend past-year questions.
* Analyze past-year question patterns.
* Generate similar practice questions.
* Recommend learning materials according to student weaknesses.
* Send examination and study notifications.
* Encourage students to participate actively in learning.
* Track student learning activities and progress.
* Monitor the student's complete four-year bachelor's journey.
* Store academic results, skills, projects, and achievements.
* Analyze the student's complete four-year performance using AI.
* Generate an overall student performance report after graduation.
* Identify suitable career fields based on student performance, skills, and interests.
* Recommend suitable internships and job opportunities.
* Allow students to view and approve job applications.
* Provide suitable student profiles to recruiters with student permission.
* Allow recruiters to view relevant academic achievements, skills, projects, and experience.
* Match students with suitable job requirements.
* Support students from university enrollment to graduation and employment.


